  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Populated `AreaCtx::blocked` in `crates/app/src/operation/boundary_ctx.rs` for whole-model (`SrcRef::Entity`) and stock-source (`SrcRef::Stock`) pocket-family operations (`2D Pocket`, `2D Adaptive`, `2D Offset`) while keeping `islands` as `false`.\n- Added `unreached_corners` and `unreached_corner_note` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/unreached.rs` (re-exported in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs`) to detect residual sharp-corner cusps wider than `0.03 mm` half-width and clip them against the setup stock outline so extended air corners do not warn.\n- Updated `keep_law::narrow_noted` and its call site in `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` to append the corner residual note on clearing operations around parts.\n- Surfaced non-empty operation `path.notes` as `\"notes\"` in `crates/app/src/script/api.rs::op_view` so MCP `generate` and `verify` report the corner note without changing empty responses.\n- Updated `crates/app/tests/keep_law.rs` (`a_whole_model_extension_keeps_the_part_and_posts`), added `crates/app/tests/adaptive_zero_margin_island.rs`, and recorded the choices in `docs/decisions/2438-adaptive-zero-margin-corners.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nDefault whole-model and stock-source clearing keeps the cutter inside the setup stock box, which necessarily leaves uncut triangular corner cusps at sharp 90-degree stock corners around an island. The narrow-band detector only reported whole disconnected bands that eroded to empty, and `op_view` did not expose `path.notes`, so callers saw an `ok` verdict with silent unreached stock corners. Meanwhile, `boundary_ctx::build` left `blocked = None` for `SrcRef::Entity` and `SrcRef::Stock` pocket-family operations, so setting `Boundary` `extension` to clear the stock corners shrank the interior island hole too and drove cuts straight through standing part geometry.\n\n## Tests\n\n- **Pins (`crates/app/tests/adaptive_zero_margin_island.rs`)**:\n  - `zero_margin_adaptive_around_island_names_uncut_stock_corners`: failed on unchanged `7bcc13a4b` (missing `notes` in MCP `generate`), passes after fix (verifies `rest.max > 4.0` and corner note on `generate` and `verify`).\n  - `extension_on_island_on_plate_grows_only_exterior_clears_corners_part_source` and `_stock_source`: failed on unchanged `7bcc13a4b` (`verify` reported island gouges), pass after fix (zero gouge cells, stock corners cleared to floor, posts cleanly, no corner note).\n  - `extension_with_top_allowance_keeps_island_untouched_and_clears_corners`: failed on unchanged `7bcc13a4b` (`Gouge` + `RapidInStock`), passes after fix under `+2 mm` stock allowance.\n- **Unit tests (`crates/motion/src/machining2d/unreached.rs::law`)**: 4 tests pass (`sharp_stock_corners_around_island_are_named_until_extended`, `filleted_corners_and_unreached_bands_emit_no_corner_note`, `a_band_narrower_than_the_tool_beside_a_wide_bore_is_named`, `a_noise_sliver_and_an_empty_region_say_nothing`).\n- **Keep law (`crates/app/tests/keep_law.rs`)**: `a_whole_model_extension_keeps_the_part_and_posts` passes while `a_whole_model_area_offset_into_the_part_gouges_and_never_posts` and `stock_source` keep pins stay intact.\n- **Mutation checks**:\n  - Reverted `boundary_ctx.rs` to `upstream/main`: `extension_*` pins in `adaptive_zero_margin_island` failed (3 failed); restored: passed.\n  - Reverted `keep_law.rs` + `generate.rs` to `upstream/main`: `zero_margin_adaptive_around_island_names_uncut_stock_corners` failed (`generate notes missing corner warning`); restored: passed.\n  - Reverted `script/api.rs` to `upstream/main`: `zero_margin_adaptive_around_island_names_uncut_stock_corners` failed (`generate exposes op notes`); restored: passed.\n- **Clippy & Gate**:\n  - `cargo xtask gate batch --only clippy` (`--all-targets -- -D warnings` across all workspace crates): passed in 366s.\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 200 of 202 steps passed (all `motion` suites + 140 of 142 `app` suites, including `adaptive_zero_margin_island` in 39s, `keep_law`, `narrow_band`, `adaptive_pinch`, `area_controls`, `area_overhead`, `setup_align_2d_area`, `mcp_verify`, `mcp_generate`).\n  - `app:shoulder_adaptive::containment_outside_clears_past_the_edge_never_the_recess` failed its 60s timer under parallel gate load (81.90s) and passed when run alone (`47.97s`).\n  - `app:stock_source_holes::framed_stock_chamfer_live_refusal_keeps_hint_without_local_move_number` failed on a pre-existing `chamfer_ride::ride_loops` error (`has no wall under it`); re-running on unmodified branch base `7bcc13a4b` (`#2450`) produced the exact same failure in 0.01s.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main` / `7bcc13a4b` on `*.nc` and `*.cl` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `cargo xtask gate release` (heavy `#[ignore]` lanes and UI snapshots; no UI code changed).\n- Pre-existing failing test `stock_source_holes::framed_stock_chamfer_live_refusal_keeps_hint_without_local_move_number` remains red from `#2450` on `upstream/main`.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- `#2149` touches `crates/app/src/operation/boundary_ctx.rs` (`part_solid_of`, `area_ctx`, `op_stamp`) and `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` (`Pocket`/`Offset2D`/`Pocket3D`), different functions/lines; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#2253` touches `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` (`Pocket`) and `crates/app/src/script/api.rs::op_view` (inside `if warnings`), different block/lines; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#2460` and `#1713` touch `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` (`Contour` and `Finish3D` arms), different lines; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#2487` (merged to `upstream/main` after `7bcc13a4b`) touches `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs` line 124 (`contour_run_side`), different line from our line 142 (`unreached`).\n\nChangelog: Whole-model and stock-source 2D clearing now reports unreached stock corners in notes (and MCP generate/verify) and keeps standing part islands blocked when extending outside the stock.\nFixes #2438\n",
